  unitName: Metal Mimic
  unitId: 60224
  unitNumber: 481
  description: A member of the metal record species that mimics a treasure chest.
    It's said that it's made up of metal record monsters who hid from their enemies
    and fused inside the chest before evolving and deciding to take revenge instead,
    though the truth is unknown. Though it looks like a Bat Mimic, it boasts the
    defense of a member of the metal record species. As hard as they are to encounter,
    they're even harder to deal with once one comes across one.
  summonDesc: Whoa there!<br>Ah, umm...no wait!<br>Yeah, let's have some fun!
  fusionDesc: 
  evoDesc: Hmm...<br>What happened to me!?<br>Did I evolve!?
